<p>Russian forces launched a large wave of missiles and drones across Ukraine over March 7–8. One strike hit a five-story apartment building in Kharkiv, Ukraine’s second-largest city, killing at least 10 people, including two children, and injuring others. Separate strikes and air attacks were also reported in Kyiv and other regions, and Ukrainian officials said the bombardment damaged energy and railway infrastructure. President Volodymyr Zelenskyy condemned the attacks and urged partners to respond, as Ukraine’s air defenses worked to intercept incoming missiles and drones. Emergency services continued rescue operations at the damaged residential building in Kharkiv as officials reported casualties and infrastructure damage.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/AX4eCXNKFEkOB6xavHjCy52RpzQPMhMQwp2EZIHZsWNLppb4Bn4rDuXZUwrJlVz6SAni4jaqOxpSXfby0HaBckLM5HngvlLUH27Xz_KaOhy5WB5wQF9z77RON196YtTP1Ln5rWgBxgVd8GBINmtbo2wX57fxWEnKSkXvsgK8EheAl-PZo0ewiS4h8sTaQf6imijI6HovX4sR5w' alt='Emergency workers removing the body of a victim from the site of an overnight strike on an apartment building in Kharkiv, Ukraine.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Scale and composition: Zelenskyy said Russia fired 29 missiles and 480 drones in the wave of attacks, with several aimed at energy and railway infrastructure.</li><li>Local fallout in Kharkiv: Kharkiv Oblast governor Oleh Syniehubov said the strikes killed ten people, including two children, injured ten, and damaged the city’s power grids.</li><li>Weapon detail: Al Jazeera said the Kharkiv strike involved what it described as a “new missile,” as the broader assault hit civilian and energy infrastructure.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Volodymyr Zelenskyy (Ukraine): Zelenskyy condemned the strikes and called for a stronger international response, saying partners need to act after attacks on civilians and infrastructure. (<a href='https://www.cbsnews.com/news/russia-ukraine-war-missile-strike-kharkiv/'>CBS News</a>)</li><li>Kharkiv regional authorities: Kharkiv Oblast governor Oleh Syniehubov said strikes hit residential areas, killing ten people including two children, injuring ten, and damaging power grids. (<a href='https://www.ctvnews.ca/world/russia-ukraine-war/article/at-least-8-killed-in-ukraines-kharkiv-as-russian-missile-hits-apartment-building'>CTV News</a>)</li><li>RFE/RL (state-linked reporting of Ukrainian officials): RFE/RL said the northeast city of Kharkiv was hit early on March 8 in an attack involving missiles and drones, and that it prompted Zelenskyy to press Western partners to respond. (<a href='https://www.rferl.org/a/zelenskyy-ukraine-kharkiv-russia-war-defense/33698707.html'>RFE/RL</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/russian-strikes-on-ukraine-kharkiv-kill-several/article70715028.ece'>Russian strikes kill 12 across Ukraine</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><a href='https://www.cbsnews.com/news/russia-ukraine-war-missile-strike-kharkiv/'>Russian strike on apartment building kills at least 8 in Ukraine</a> - cbsnews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.pbs.org/newshour/world/russian-missile-hits-apartment-building-in-ukraines-kharkiv-killing-at-least-10'>Russian missile hits apartment building in Ukraine&#x27;s Kharkiv killing at least 10</a> - pbs.org</li><li><a href='https://www.rferl.org/a/zelenskyy-ukraine-kharkiv-russia-war-defense/33698707.html'>Russian Strike On Kharkiv Residential Building Kills At Least 10, Ukraine Says</a> - rferl.org</li><li><a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/03/07/world/europe/russia-ukraine-kharkiv-zelensky-airstrike.html'>Russia Attacks Kharkiv and Kyiv in Ukraine</a> - nytimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/3/7/russia-kills-10-in-kharkiv-strike-including-children-using-new-missile'>Russia kills 10 in Ukraine strike including children with new missile</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://www.ctvnews.ca/world/russia-ukraine-war/article/at-least-8-killed-